        "and a **27.3x size difference** (89,606 encoder parameters against 2,445,478) at "
        "statistically indistinguishable robustness -- which for a Fast ML challenge is the more "
        "decision-relevant axis once the metric is exhausted. Stated plainly: the two models reach "
